    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the eve of the end of the world, become the last hope for the world by standing alone against thousands of monsters. Chrono Survival is a hyper arcade rogue-lite game that combines simple gameplay and challenge. Inspired by games such as Vampire Survivors, Path of Exile and The Binding of Isaac. Minimalistic gameplay and deep building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.poster.avif?t=1728666531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.webm?t=1728666531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.mp4?t=1728666531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many abilities and opportunities to combine and modify them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mighty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different game events make every run varied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch integration.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the eve of the end of the world, become the last hope for the world by standing alone against thousands of monsters. Chrono Survival is a hyper arcade rogue-lite game that combines simple gameplay and challenge. Inspired by games such as Vampire Survivors, Path of Exile and The Binding of Isaac. Minimalistic gameplay and deep building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.poster.avif?t=1728666531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.webm?t=1728666531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897740/extras/3ea1b66cb46cdb770b1884262e42f21e.mp4?t=1728666531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many abilities and opportunities to combine and modify them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mighty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different game events make every run varied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch integration.</p></li></ul>",
